      50.64,
      411.44,
      286.45,
      456.56
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.8,
      459.92,
      202.92,
      483.68
    ],
    "text": "Details of the land to be obtained :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      485.86,
      321.43,
      550.16
    ],
    "text": "Following lands mentioned in the preliminary Plan No. 2677 of surveyor General Matara and situated in village of Waththegama Grama Niladhari Division of Waththegama North in Dickwella Divisional Secretariat of Matara District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      562.16,
      286.42,
      621.2
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: Kollanmaruwa; Description: Home Garden, Mixed Cultivation is there; Extent: 0.0133 Hectare Claimed by: K. K. Sarith Anandapriya, 43 B, New Town, Katharagama.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.46,
      618.56
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 2 Name of the land: Wedagedarawatta; Description: Home Garden, Mixed Cultivation is there; Extent: 0.0190 Hectare. Claimed by: M. H. T. Indrani, Wedagedarawatta, Kollanmaruwa, Waththegama. All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Dickwella divisional Secretary\u2019s Office on 28.12.2016 at 10.30 a.m. are herby requested and notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 21.12.2016 the nature of there interest in the land, the particulars of there claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount all deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry. B. S. RANJITHA, Divisional Secretary, Divisional Secretariat Dickwella. Divisional Secretariat Office Dickwella. 21st November, 2016. 12-396",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
